Release 5 / Serial number 170213 / Inform v6.34 Library 6/11 S

Image Room
A voice booooms out: Try "split NUMBER fixed" or "split NUMBER percent" to adjust the graphics window height. Type "show" to show the current height, or "close" to close the graphics window entirely.

Type "color COLOR" to set the default color; "fill COLOR X,Y WxH" to fill a rectangle; "erase X,Y WxH" to erase a rectangle to the default color. (No space after the comma.) "clear" will erase the entire graphics window.

Type "image", or "image NUMBER", or "image NUMBER X,Y" to display an image. Adding a "WxH" term will scale the image to those dimensions.

You can also type "size NUMBER" to check an image size. Images that should be available (imported from Sensory Jam): 0, 1, 2, 5, 10, 11.

>show
The current graphics window is above, 200 (fixed). Its size is 640 by 208 pixels.

>size 0
Image 0 size: 125 by 180.

>size 1
Image 1 size: 150 by 180.

>size 2
Image 2 size: 155 by 180.

>size 5
Image 5 size: 47 by 62.

>size 10
Image 10 size: 128 by 128.

>size 11
Image 11 size: 128 by 128.

>size 3
There is no image 3.

>image 1
Image 1 at 0,0.

>image 2 40,20
Image 2 at 40,20.

>image 5 10,10 120x60
Image 5 at 10,10 120x60.

>image 11 -20,-10
Image 11 at -20,-10.

>image 1 900,900
Image 1 at 900,900.

>color blue
Set default window color to $0000FF.

>fill red 10,10 60x40
Filled rectangle with color $FF0000 at 10,10 60x40.

>fill 00ff00 30,20 40x30
Filled rectangle with color $00FF00 at 30,20 40x30.

>erase 20,20 15x15
Erased rectangle at 20,20 15x15.

>clear
You erase the window.

>color black
Set default window color to $000000.

>clear
You erase the window.

>split 100 fixed
Changed window to 100 pixels high.

>show
The current graphics window is above, 100 (fixed). Its size is 640 by 112 pixels.

>split 40 percent
Changed window to 40 percent of the screen.

>show
The current graphics window is above, 40 (percent). Its size is 640 by 144 pixels.

>close
Graphics window closed.

>show
There is no graphics window.

>quit
Are you sure you want to quit? y
